26614565733180_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5a5Q7djBahMQ7kNvwF_OMzn&_nc_oc=Adqqkl5ULHwfpZ_dEBdeF4hmK3b36ubYc45fDgObuJb1ELNHR--hOH6IQ-DBaVYfM3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQgZN6XAU1eNlXOxiWbD28M2huJyjC00o-kKScSod0jTQ&oe=6B0DC713"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "DUET Drone Simulator", "keywords": ["drone", "simulator", "education", "STEM"], "long_description": "DUET Drone Simulator teaches students to fly drones the way real ones fly, without the cost or risk of crashing a real aircraft.\n\n- Three aircraft: a camera drone with GPS hold, auto take-off, landing and return home; a 5-inch FPV racer with Angle, Horizon and Acro modes; and a tiny indoor whoop.\n- Real physics: motor spin-up, thrust, battery voltage sag, wind and gusts, ground effect, and crashes into trees, wires and buildings.\n- Radio link that weakens with distance and is blocked by hills and buildings, with video breaking up like the real thing.\n- Three large maps: a village with fields and a race track, a solar park with a substation and power lines, and a Himalayan valley.\n- Missions: free flight, racing against your own ghost, training lessons, solar panel inspection, and search and rescue up the valley.\n- Fly in VR standing in the field, or in mixed reality with the drone flying in your own room.\n- Camera screen, FPV view, chase and line-of-sight views, photos, video and replays.\n- Works offline after the first launch.\n\nFor schools: full access comes with a DUET STEM school subscription code. Without a code, a free 10-minute demo is available every day.", "short_description": "Learn to fly drones safely in a realistic simulator: real flight physics, wind, battery and radio range, a camera drone with GPS, an FPV racer and missions over a village, a solar park and a Himalayan valley."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ashutoshduet.g